{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "175cceb118e0b6ed50918043dc880e9b06b8559c3c8b34dd074abff91e456800", "ja": "初めてのチアダンス！", "zh": "第一次跳啦啦操！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "406ced847729499520dbe409c074dbc12f6116290f65aaa74ecf49676d3f7242", "ja": "朝の駅前でチアダンスを開始する4人。忙し\nなく行き交う人々を楽しませ、元気にして\nいく……と、懸命に踊るジュリアの写真が\nSNSで瞬く間に拡散される。メンバーは喜\nぶ一方、ジュリアは照れるのだった。", "zh": "在车站前的清晨，4人开始了啦啦舞表演。为来往的忙碌行人带去欢乐与活力……拼命起舞的茱莉亚的照片瞬间在社交媒体上广泛传播。成员们欣喜不已，而茱莉亚却有些不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b0c0fd1515a9e45a7f2ddf3b9ae8a3050a7357437377c046a7b663968e3ffe86", "ja": "（チアのレッスンは順調に進み……いよいよ\nお披露目の日！　中央エリアの駅前にやってきた！）", "zh": "（应援舞的练习进展顺利……终于到了公开表演的日子！我们来到了中央区域的车站前！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "b320cfc7663cfa775dbff9a34bdee533430ad65bda9c1482cdfa824dd6e84ee0", "ja": "朝の駅前、人がいっぱいですね！\nスーツの人、制服の人、ほかにもたくさん……。", "zh": "早上的车站前，人好多啊！\n穿西装的、穿制服的，还有好多好多……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "258f2f93706d421372581747474aac85cae75574c737de45d468a89b2eacaa5f", "ja": "うん……。\n……みんな、忙しそう……。", "zh": "嗯……。\n……大家，好像都很忙……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "69ad90ace03d8a256a14cb2310797b9df25cced5ae17a7a325b051a492da27a5", "ja": "朝は忙しいから、ちょっとだけ\n心の余裕がないのかもしれないね。", "zh": "早上大家都很忙，可能只是心里稍微没有余裕而已呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "fd26dc5d1ef5579d8d4b1835ebc3043c7ed751860a0be2abc9cc0060b3bad6f0", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。わ、私たち、\nこの中でチアをやって、本当にいいんでしょうか～！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。我、我们真的可以在这里跳啦啦队舞吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "51a1de9c23f57cad3d1225abafdba57d31cc36d0dbbbc057939be22191638f62", "ja": "確かに、ちょっと勇気は必要だな。\nけど……。", "zh": "确实，需要一点勇气。\n不过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "7f35f2b11a9f266f7d710a46f9237a8677fbe0c0e9416c4cc8131d804ca0bffb", "ja": "だからこそ、ですよね！　これから\nお仕事や学校に行く人たちを、応援したいなって！", "zh": "正因为如此，才更应该这么做，对吧！我想为接下来要去工作或上学的人们加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "f2bdc22d6c1c2db765268d6d3f1327fe33327a57f7dd984cbdd540a02e5c6c55", "ja": "ま、でも駅前なんて、こんなもんじゃないか？\nいつもピリピリした雰囲気っていうか。", "zh": "不过，车站前不就是这样吗？总感觉气氛一直都很紧绷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "2197e374b1af74e51bd167adf20a4c59e23bccd84f51fb878775c776ec2dbbe5", "ja": "ジュリアさんも、駅前で歌ってた……の……？\nどんな感じ、だった……？", "zh": "茱莉亚先生也在车站前唱过歌……吗……？\n是什么样的感觉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "570efda3b857e95386263ba009e4541ddbed669de98488960507fc5abaa42822", "ja": "あたしのはチアじゃなくて、\nストリートライブだからなぁ……。", "zh": "我那是街头演出，不是啦啦队表演……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "39975bd492b85ace121650d44e31c7f239d5779713cc4f9fb8cac5be8cba4d32", "ja": "でも、あたしの歌を聞いてこっちを見たり、\n立ち止まってくれる人がいたのは、うれしかったよ！", "zh": "不过，能有人听到我的歌后转过头来看我，甚至停下脚步，我还是很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "3fc4a4fbbf16b4518f7cf85b0dfc0b30d3f3e90783bd5c61e2feb0b1f9e8078e", "ja": "ジュリアちゃんは、ストリートライブで\nたくさんの人に元気をあげてたんだね。", "zh": "茱莉亚给许多人带去了活力呢，就像街头演出时那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "65deddcc4a922a0d4da09a0e2bedd1d8bfe8560608228f228b2b7f5f332e6f12", "ja": "今回はチアライブだけど……伝える気持ちは、\nきっと変わらないって思うな。", "zh": "这次虽然是啦啦队演出……但我觉得，想要传达的心意一定不会改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "e33dbfb2ecafc9a9dcda3a1886b71351aaff36024372db2cd48e79dd58e8af7d", "ja": "そうだな……あたしも、できればみんなには、\nいい気分で1日をスタートさせてほしいって思うよ。", "zh": "是啊……我也希望大家能尽量心情愉快地迎来1日。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "c4e36473dbc7ce56bdfdcc71da3ffe4d74fc01ceb8ec0ce1474cd622f21f71b6", "ja": "元気を届ける側が、いつまでも恥ずかしがって\nられないよな……覚悟決めて、飛び込んでやる！", "zh": "作为传递活力的一方，不能一直害羞下去啊……\n做好觉悟，放手一搏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "a7349e579088b8d75257dbbdf6dad1ba452a426b9956d9741c2608f444db745d", "ja": "うん……！　みんなで、朝の駅前に……\n元気を、届け、ます……！", "zh": "嗯……！　大家一起，给早上的车站前……\n送去，活，力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1016_null", "source_sha256": "c098488a9d3c97db2bd2d51901b06e48dfe835e6af9d812f100220cb3d29e678", "ja": "チアライブ後……", "zh": "啦啦队演出后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "37ba3453b8fa542bffccacbcc77f9a07861c1c8a4f0a45319aac16faa4b1772c", "ja": "私たちの元気、受け取ってもらえましたか～？\n今日も一日、頑張っていきましょう～！", "zh": "大家有没有感受到我们带来的活力呢～？\n今天也要元气满满地加油哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1018_shakaijin1", "source_sha256": "eb9d0f52c4726b80ad15545a3ec7e0063b59511017bf20714ea85508827c2669", "ja": "ありがとー！　頑張るよー！\n見とけよ係長！　プレゼンが、俺のステージだ！！", "zh": "谢谢啦——！我会加油的——！\n好好看着吧，股长！汇报展示，就是我的舞台！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1019_daigakusei1", "source_sha256": "1686a36bf43cd02bd24bd8fc339be918013151ee5b5b9c5af614e26455b39bc2", "ja": "なんだかやる気が出てきちゃった！\n課題、いけそうな気がする！", "zh": "不知怎么的，干劲一下子上来了！\n感觉这次的课题能搞定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1020_josikosei3", "source_sha256": "f4e3e1c659959722e2af00ee22c9a6515d4c3b56fb5a57b384aefa9d7065f83c", "ja": "えっ、765プロの春香ちゃん！？\nウソッ、見逃しちゃったぁ……。", "zh": "咦，765事务所的春香！？  \n不会吧，居然错过了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "e59157102c8085dfadb65d17f524f14bbfb412113dee42b2bc22cb3424c40803", "ja": "はーい！\nそれじゃあ、もう一度、始めからやりますね～！", "zh": "好——！\n那么，我们再从头开始一次吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "50ddab6cf11f03c826d34da5b5301bf576cccaf2fab185820f821284cccd7ef9", "ja": "えっ！？　も、もう1回って……\n連続でやるのか！？", "zh": "诶！？已、已经是第1次了……\n\n还要连续来吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "31562967e6f973d45511b1f95ea95bb00ab29f3bd1c5021fb69f3703d827386e", "ja": "見てる人、すぐ入れ替わるから……続けないと……。\n応援は……何回でも、うれしい……です。", "zh": "看的人一直在换……所以要不停地做……。不管多少次，被支持……都很开心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "ad72519fbcd5db5ed9a963e1c0196fb2a24ddf9504ce877d81a1cbc575797978", "ja": "そうそう！　みんなを元気にするには、\n私たちも思いっきり頑張らないと！", "zh": "对对！要让大家打起精神来，\n我们也得拼尽全力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "612ea54660702c43786bfcb7578bb9b29cdd80efb45d39be26ea2a0bb3bb1874", "ja": "くぅ……わ、分かったよ！\nこうなったら3回でも4回でも、踊ってやる！！", "zh": "唔……好、好吧！既然这样，跳3次也好，4次也好，我都跳！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4bee98bf4d14dc87bb677e172fa589ca536ee75f5c3ed4498bd716a08386c510", "ja": "（想像していたよりも、通行人のウケは良さそうだ。\n初回とは思えないくらい、いい手応えだぞ！）", "zh": "（路人的反应似乎比想象中还要好。完全不像是第一次，反馈相当不错！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "a44c1fd69bb110a7e5fa82f2274b51477710777b7e7e79851e4eacd0a994a899", "ja": "はあ、はあ……疲れた。\nチアダンス、想像以上に体力勝負だな……。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……累死了。\n啦啦队舞蹈比想象中更考验体力啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "f65b5374a75bf29d9f66c5e1ba21c371d4742e7a949630d88e9e58ce7a59ee05", "ja": "私もクタクタですけど……見ている人たちが笑顔で\n手を振ってくれて、すっごく楽しかったです！", "zh": "我也累得筋疲力尽了……不过看到大家笑着朝我挥手，真的特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "773ae54c86adac01e840abf488a1ddfbe7c1f60966891d432587fb623fe981f7", "ja": "元気に全力チアライブ～♪\nみーんな笑顔で、いってきま～す♪　えへっ♪", "zh": "精神满满地全力应援演出～♪\n大家都笑容满面，我要上场啦～♪嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "cc874ad9dc22865dc94f66a38e64064af0d9dbc8bd2080b481919e61525c2224", "ja": "可奈、まだ歌えるのか。すごいな……それに比べたら\nあたしは、まだ「元気をあげる」所まで行けてないな。", "zh": "可奈，你还唱得动啊。真厉害……相比之下，\n我还没到能“带给别人精神”的程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "cc9cfa54ac05c91038eada8a854f8c108fa586047caf92804c0c4d7a570c442a", "ja": "……？　ジュリアさんに、元気をもらった人……\nいると思う、よ……？", "zh": "……？我觉得，应该有人……从茱莉亚先生那里获得了活力吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "7934b615f8a3ea2d16599000c0b39ae88ed831f6d7cf9c9161d4287d66e7e500", "ja": "あたしから？　ははっ、ないない。", "zh": "从我这里？哈哈，不可能不可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1034_024ann", "source_sha256": "77448894e86cc1da2ac1cc5b3bf9205fbaac90c14e386c6c83cc6ab65da54fdd", "ja": "そんなこと、ない……。\n……ちょっと、待って……。", "zh": "没那回事……。\n……等一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1035_024ann", "source_sha256": "f370adeb235fddcf4ce668c5fdc29871e991529bb2025054e9b40e74378eeae5", "ja": "これ……見て。\nジュリアさん……。", "zh": "你……看这个。\n茱莉亚先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "ca0fbbf48e735284b9e91afad4fa512ff4527e2f535fd3f043d9d0f9bb075091", "ja": "えっ……これ、チアダンスしてるあたしか！？\nなんでこんな写真が！？", "zh": "诶……这是在跳啦啦队舞的我！？\n为什么会有这样的照片！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1037_024ann", "source_sha256": "179faa6473f2ea28f7b9250a9b41783b16a65e524f341d9dba59bc9cb097e939", "ja": "今……SNSで、バズってる……。\n見た人が、アップした……かも。", "zh": "现在……在社交平台上，火起来了……。\n看到的人上传的……也说不定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "c806afd18a01b236415665d55a1603b7fb0e085260614c18a648a37d458c1e87", "ja": "『恥ずかしがってるところが逆にかわいかった』\n……って、コメントが書いてありますよ！", "zh": "评论里写着：“害羞的样子反而更可爱。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "7676798ec7dfeda2ec2788f29694dfb4a33028c75a8e1c9027dad376cc937b63", "ja": "マジか！　ていうか、\nこんな写真が広まるなんて……！", "zh": "真的假的！话说回来，\n这种照片居然会传开……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "7f3c86f0dacd522422b846587c8d37cc7946997c9963332ac6b3454122e01359", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nもしかして、これを狙ってたのか……？", "zh": "{$P$}……难道，你早就瞄准这个了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1041_p", "source_sha256": "41953e4f8c92c5bedfc87156f4f75f57abe558dba166a3740abb51a7e27c3890", "ja": "狙ってなかったと言ったらウソになるけど……\nまさか、初日でバズるとは思わなかったかな。", "zh": "要说没想过这个，那是骗人的，不过……没想到第一天就火了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "e737c2c0bb0215125765a47265da0f3f6a7e5ff958f9a74e0ff5ac7f28b4095c", "ja": "さすがだな！　良かったな、みんな！", "zh": "不愧是你！太好了，大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1043_050jul", "source_sha256": "3b65663e3441f55072e8c9e2d8c4e4eadf2bd9c215e1fdce0e0b8c5030f21c78", "ja": "さすがだな、じゃないだろ！？", "zh": "别说什么“不愧是你”了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1044_001har", "source_sha256": "5e77076a6520c6bdbf3c2ff85ce4b7aa8c7cbde229de62e98df0ba82df1c5fbd", "ja": "でも『ジュリアちゃんのおかげで今日も頑張れそう！』\nだって。ジュリアちゃんの応援、ちゃんと届いてるよ！", "zh": "不过，她说：“多亏了茱莉亚，今天也能继续努力了！”  \n茱莉亚的加油，确实传达到了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1045_050jul", "source_sha256": "0d4bb9a71145cb06352013f450ff6ba7fba3ddedd173e757ba71caea83594ada", "ja": "た、確かにそれは、よかったけど……。\nああ、もう！　釈然としないー！", "zh": "虽、虽然那样确实挺好的……  \n啊啊，真是的！总觉得还是不痛快——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_02_1046_050jul", "source_sha256": "a69f9e0a544cf51563c30793a3287016e3f0f462f4f82dd6127bc025b551a5bf", "ja": "覚えてろよ、バカP！　……くぅ。", "zh": "你给我记住啊，笨蛋P！……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
